{"path":"thread/cnd_destroy","title":"cnd_destroy","titleHtml":"cnd_destroy","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/thread/cnd_destroy","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"Destroys the condition variable pointed to by cond.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/thread\"><code>&lt;threads.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> cnd_destroy<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/c/thread\"><span class=\"kw1025\">cnd_t</span></a><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> cond <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c11\">(since C11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Destroys the condition variable pointed to by <code>cond</code>.\n</p><p>If there are threads waiting on <code>cond</code>, the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  cond\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  pointer to the condition variable to destroy\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-17\">\n<ul><li> C17 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2018): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.26.3.2 The cnd_destroy function (p: 276)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-11\">\n<ul><li> C11 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2011): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.26.3.2 The cnd_destroy function (p: 378-379)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/condition_variable/~condition_variable\">C+